---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base 
  title="Privacy Policy | Petrol Price India" 
  description="Privacy Policy for Petrol Price India. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our fuel tracking services."
>
  <Navbar />
  
  <main class="flex-grow">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-mute">Last Updated: June 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to Petrol Price India ("we," "our," or "us"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website petrolpriceindia.com.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">We may collect several types of information from and about users of our website, including:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Information about your internet connection, the equipment you use to access our website, and usage details (IP address, browser type, operating system).</li>
            <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> If you use our contact form or sign up for alerts, we collect your name, email address, and any other information you provide.</li>
            <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> Information about your city or fuel type preferences to provide a personalized experience.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">We use the information we collect to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Provide and maintain our services.</li>
            <li>Notify you about changes to our prices or services.</li>
            <li>Provide personalized fuel price information based on your location.</li>
            <li>Improve our website through analytics and user feedback.</li>
            <li>Respond to your inquiries and support requests.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">4. Cookies and Advertising Technologies</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to track activity on our website and hold certain information. Cookies are files with a small amount of data which may include an anonymous unique identifier. You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            In addition, we use Google AdSense to serve advertisements on our website. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on our site. Google's use of advertising cookies (such as the DoubleClick DART cookie) enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
          </p>
          <p>
            Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">Google Ads Settings</a> page. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">www.aboutads.info</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">5. Third-Party Services & Analytics</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We use Google Analytics (property ID <strong>G-QQLMPTHG7J</strong>) to monitor and analyze the use of our services. Google Analytics uses cookies to collect traffic data and details about how visitors interact with our pages. This data is collected, aggregated, and processed anonymously.
          </p>
          <p>
            For more information on the privacy practices of Google, please visit the Google Privacy & Terms web page: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">6. Security</h2>
          <p>
            The security of your data is important to us, but remember that no method of transmission over the Internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your personal data, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">7. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at yunusshabbir53@gmail.com.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
